flowchart LR
    U[Web / Mobile Client]:::client --> GW[API Gateway<br/>routing, auth, rate limit]:::design
    GW --> US[User Service]:::design
    GW --> INV[Train Inventory Service<br/>FastAPI]:::impl
    GW --> BK[Booking Service<br/>FastAPI]:::impl
    BK -- "REST: hold / confirm / release seats" --> INV
    BK -- "REST: charge / refund" --> PAY[Payment Service]:::design
    BK -. "event: BookingConfirmed / Cancelled" .-> MQ[(Message Broker<br/>RabbitMQ)]:::design
    MQ -.-> NS[Notification Service<br/>SMS / Email]:::design
    INV -. "cache search results" .-> RC[(Redis)]:::design
    US --- UDB[(User DB)]:::design
    INV --- IDB[(PostgreSQL<br/>inventory_db)]:::impl
    BK --- BDB[(PostgreSQL<br/>booking_db)]:::impl
    PAY --- PDB[(Payment DB)]:::design
    classDef impl fill:#d4f4dd,stroke:#1e7b34,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef design fill:#eef1f5,stroke:#7a8699,stroke-dasharray: 4 3,color:#000
